        "source_quote": "沖故吏青州治中房長瑜謂孜曰：「前使君忠貫昊天，操逾松竹。",
        "reading": "張沖故吏房長瑜告張孜，稱已故使君張沖忠節。",
        "note": "張沖故吏房長瑜告張孜，稱已故使君張沖忠節。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 28,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:received_sentence1-28",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "5ql_hfz_086_A",
        "source_quote": "郎君但當端坐畫一，以荷析薪。",
        "reading": "請張孜守父遺法、荷父業。",
        "note": "請張孜守父遺法、荷父業。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 28,
        "end_codepoint": 42,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:received_sentence1-42",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "5ql_hfz_086_A",
        "source_quote": "若天運不與，幅巾待命，以下從使君。",
        "reading": "若時運不順，宜待命以從故使君。這是勸語，未述張孜死事。",
        "note": "若時運不順，宜待命以從故使君。這是勸語，未述張孜死事。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 42,
        "end_codepoint": 59,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:received_sentence1-59",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "5ql_hfz_086_A",
        "source_quote": "今若隨諸人之計，非唯郢州士女失高山之望，亦恐彼所不取也。」",
        "reading": "反對附程茂等降議，憂郢州士女失望、對方亦不取。",
        "note": "反對附程茂等降議，憂郢州士女失望、對方亦不取。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 59,
